@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Practice exam: Exam.IsMock = true, same exam window and save/submit endpoints as a real exam
' (ExamDashboard.PracticeButton_OnClick, ExamsController.GetPracticeExams / StartSession,
' SubmissionService.FinalizeAsync, StudentPortalController and AnalyticsService leave IsMock out)
' Simplified labels: endpoints and error codes are in the chapter text.
' Large font at dpi 96. Printed pt = fontSize * printed_width_pt / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  TitleFontSize 23
}

|Desktop App|
start
:Pick a practice exam,
press Practice;
|Server|
if (Eligible, open,
seat and readiness OK?) then ([yes])
  :Resume or create
  the session;
else ([no])
  :Refuse with
  a message;
  |Desktop App|
  :Show the
  message;
  stop
endif
|Desktop App|
:Open exam window
in Report mode,
no webcam;
:Answer, auto-save,
submit;
|Server|
:Finalise with receipt,
auto-mark if AI on,
no plagiarism check,
not in results;
|Desktop App|
:Show receipt
(no mark);
stop
@enduml
